WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.229 --> 00:00:04.950
The next setting I want to talk about in the rendering section

2
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.429
controls Lumen.

3
00:00:06.429 --> 00:00:08.949
If we take a look at the Lumen section,

4
00:00:08.949 --> 00:00:10.750
we'll see that there are a number of things

5
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.550
we can do, such as adjust the reflection method,

6
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.070
change the reflection capture resolution,

7
00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:19.510
and also adjust the software ray tracing mode.

8
00:00:19.510 --> 00:00:21.070
Again, each one of these settings

9
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:25.670
is going to have a direct effect on how Lumen will work.

10
00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:29.350
And I highly recommend that you test this.

11
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.750
One thing to note that hardware ray tracing is more expensive,

12
00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.750
but it will run on a console.

13
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:38.189
And when you're running hardware ray tracing on a console,

14
00:00:38.189 --> 00:00:42.990
you will need to set your FPS target to 30 instead of 60.
